  "body": ">[!IMPORTANT]\r\n> dd-trace-java version [v1.68.1](https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-java/releases/tag/v1.68.1)\r\n\r\n## What's changed\r\n🐛 Fix Lambda AppSec processing without a source IP and duplicate cookies (https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-java/pull/12994 - @claponcet)\r\n🐛 Parse X-Forwarded-Port in Lambda without exceptions (quick fix) (https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-java/pull/12791 - @dougqh)\r\n🐛 Flush LLM Obs intake writer synchronously in serverless environments (https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-java/pull/12249 - @purple4reina)\r\n\r\n## dd-trace-java layer ARN:\r\n\r\n### AWS Regions\r\n```\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:dd-trace-java:30\r\n```\r\n\r\n### AWS gov regions\r\n```\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:<AWS_GOV_REGION>:002406178527:layer:dd-trace-java:30\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-java/compare/v1.67.1...v1.68.1",
